1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,067
Every morning, this whole city runs for the train.

2
00:00:03,067 --> 00:00:04,227
Hold the door!

3
00:00:04,846 --> 00:00:06,300
Me? I don't run.

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,420
Headway puts my next Caltrain right before my eyes.

5
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:12,050
And my phone taps me when it's time to go.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,180
Headway. Your next Caltrain, at a glance.
